GAL16V8
VPA VMA DTACK Generator

CLK FC0  FC1  VPA  P5   P6   P7   P8   P9   GND
OE  P12  P13  P14  P15  P16  VPAOUT  DTACK  VMA  VCC

; VPA_OUT is purely combinational.
; It uses De Morgan's law to convert the equation into an OR form,
; which is more efficient for the GAL's AND-OR array.
; Original equation: VPA_OUT = NOT( NOT VPA AND FC1 AND FC0 )
VPAOUT = VPA + /FC1 + /FC0

; VMA is VPA delayed by one clock cycle.
; The '.R' operator denotes a registered (clocked) output.
VMA.R = VPA

; DTACK is VPA delayed by two clock cycles.
; Chaining the registers like this achieves the two-cycle delay
; using only the available macrocells on the GAL16V8.
DTACK.R = VMA

DESCRIPTION